//
// Written: David_Harris@hmc.edu 9 January 2021
//// Modified by sanarayanan@hmc.edu, May 2025
// Modified:
//
// Purpose: Wally Testbench and helper modules
//          Applies test programs from the riscv-arch-test and other custom tests
//
